---
mdv: "1.0"
title: First contentful chart in a 50-block document
---

## Quarterly performance

The reader sees the first chart long before the fiftieth. What this case measures
is that promise: resolve the whole document, then lay out and render block one.

```mdv area
title: Bookings by channel
x: quarter
y: bookings
series: channel
height: 320
---
quarter | channel | bookings
Q1      | direct  |      482
Q1      | partner |      414
Q1      | self    |      344
Q2      | direct  |      530
Q2      | partner |      441
Q2      | self    |      360
Q3      | direct  |      498
Q3      | partner |      470
Q3      | self    |      434
Q4      | direct  |      640
Q4      | partner |      602
Q4      | self    |      651
```
